+### The entrance display did not show my agenda
+
+Some doors update the Recent check-ins list without opening a welcome on this kiosk. A door that sends only your name can show the large first-name greeting immediately. Your agenda opens when the kiosk receives your fob’s card ID and verifies your membership. If the greeting stays on screen, tap your own active fob on the reader beside the display. Check your expiration date on the portal Home page and your door scans in [Check-In Activity](/digital-makerspace/members/check-in-activity). If the local tap or a welcome-enabled door still fails, tell the board which reader you used and when.
+
+### The entrance display showed another welcome while I was reading
+
+A door arrival can replace an agenda immediately. A local tap that opens your character sheet or kudos gives you 30 seconds before a waiting arrival with a verified fob takes over. A name-only arrival leaves that view on screen. Tap your fob to open your agenda again. You can also scan the portal QR code and use your own phone.
